  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 2905.03 Transfer Completion. The transfer shall be complete when the ATS administrator has verified that:\n\n(a) Each allowance listed in the transfer request is held by the originating account at the time the transfer was recorded;\n\n(b) The acquiring party has an account in the ATS; and\n\n(c) The transfer request was filed by the person named as AAR for the originating account.\n\nSource. #7888, eff 5-13-03; ss by #9908, INTERIM, eff 5-13-11, EXPIRES: 11-9-11; ss by #10002, eff 10-1-11 (from Env-A 2907.05); ss by #12995, eff 2-25-20",
